{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02289","headline":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 五月 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 五月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雕玉押帘上，轻縠笼虚门。\n井汲铅华水，扇织鸳鸯文。\n回雪舞凉殿，甘露洗空绿。\n罗袖从徊翔，香汗沾宝粟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}